1
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:12,312
[Message deleted
Message deleted
Wrong send Sorry]

2
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:29,496
Jihoon…

3
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,165
What are you doing here…?

4
00:00:32,432 --> 00:00:33,967
They said it might snow today…

5
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:36,503
So I thought of you…

6
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,873
We used to make snowmen together

7
00:00:41,107 --> 00:00:43,376
But it's not snowing

8
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,945
You really like it when it snows

9
00:00:48,048 --> 00:00:49,649
Aren't you cold?

10
00:00:52,352 --> 00:00:54,054
Why are you doing this…?

11
00:01:09,602 --> 00:01:12,939
You get cold so easily
Why are you dressed like this?

12
00:01:12,939 --> 00:01:15,475
Why do you care?

13
00:01:17,043 --> 00:01:19,279
You're really cold…

14
00:01:20,847 --> 00:01:23,783
Why did you delete the messages?

15
00:01:25,452 --> 00:01:28,588
I don't know… you didn't read them

16
00:01:28,588 --> 00:01:31,524
I thought I was overthinking again…

17
00:01:31,524 --> 00:01:34,394
What was it about?

18
00:01:37,163 --> 00:01:39,399
My phone was broken

19
00:01:39,399 --> 00:01:43,803
I got it fixed earlier… but it was all gone

20
00:01:43,803 --> 00:01:45,605
Are you disappointed?

21
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:47,907
That it got deleted?

22
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:52,812
Jihoon…

23
00:01:55,048 --> 00:01:57,550
Talking about loving each other again…

24
00:01:58,017 --> 00:01:59,652
About trying again…

25
00:01:59,652 --> 00:02:02,255
You know we shouldn't say things like that, right?

26
00:02:02,856 --> 00:02:05,058
We're already over

27
00:02:05,058 --> 00:02:07,694
You know better than this

28
00:02:09,362 --> 00:02:11,464
But I…

29
00:02:12,799 --> 00:02:16,002
I can't handle us becoming strangers

30
00:02:16,002 --> 00:02:18,605
No matter who I meet, it's never enough

31
00:02:18,605 --> 00:02:20,540
And then…

32
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:23,042
When I think about you being with someone else

33
00:02:23,042 --> 00:02:25,011
It honestly drives me crazy

34
00:02:28,181 --> 00:02:30,450
I know it doesn't make sense…

35
00:02:32,886 --> 00:02:34,420
But…

36
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:36,422
Can we try again?

37
00:02:41,361 --> 00:02:44,797
You show up like this and say all this to me

38
00:02:44,797 --> 00:02:47,367
How am I supposed to take it?

39
00:02:47,367 --> 00:02:51,504
It still feels like you're not respecting my feelings

40
00:02:54,641 --> 00:02:56,876
It's cold, just go inside

41
00:03:17,230 --> 00:03:20,400
Ah… the scarf…

42
00:03:45,225 --> 00:03:47,160
Who is it?

43
00:03:53,399 --> 00:03:55,068
Jihoon…!

44
00:03:55,835 --> 00:03:56,869
Ah…

45
00:03:56,869 --> 00:04:00,974
The scarf… I realized I took it with me last night

46
00:04:01,841 --> 00:04:04,210
Is that why you came?

47
00:04:04,210 --> 00:04:05,778
Yeah

48
00:04:06,145 --> 00:04:07,947
Do you want to come in for a bit?

49
00:04:07,947 --> 00:04:10,049
Warm up before you go

50
00:04:12,385 --> 00:04:14,053
Come on

51
00:04:25,365 --> 00:04:27,133
Here

52
00:04:30,503 --> 00:04:32,672
You like this tea

53
00:04:32,672 --> 00:04:35,008
You still had this?

54
00:04:35,408 --> 00:04:38,211
We bought it when we went to Jeju together

55
00:04:38,211 --> 00:04:39,912
You remember?

56
00:04:39,912 --> 00:04:42,181
I don't really drink tea

57
00:04:49,088 --> 00:04:51,157
Hyung, honestly…

58
00:04:51,157 --> 00:04:53,726
When you asked to get back together yesterday

59
00:04:53,726 --> 00:04:57,664
I felt more worried than excited

60
00:04:58,264 --> 00:04:59,699
If we get back together…

61
00:04:59,699 --> 00:05:02,001
I'm scared we'll love each other
Then fight and break up again

62
00:05:02,001 --> 00:05:03,936
Then fight and break up again

63
00:05:03,936 --> 00:05:08,574
I don't want to feel all of that again

64
00:05:10,943 --> 00:05:13,046
It's different from back then

65
00:05:13,046 --> 00:05:15,048
It'll be different now

66
00:05:18,251 --> 00:05:22,155
Should we try again?

67
00:05:28,261 --> 00:05:30,263
Thank you

68
00:06:05,598 --> 00:06:07,200
You're already here?

69
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,801
You should've texted me

70
00:06:08,801 --> 00:06:10,803
Get in, hurry

71
00:06:22,515 --> 00:06:24,150
So where are we going?

72
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:25,918
To an exhibition

73
00:06:25,918 --> 00:06:27,887
You like going to exhibitions

74
00:06:27,887 --> 00:06:29,789
Why an exhibition all of a sudden?

75
00:06:29,789 --> 00:06:32,425
You don't even like exhibitions

76
00:06:32,725 --> 00:06:34,460
I used to not like them

77
00:06:34,460 --> 00:06:36,629
But I'm trying to now

78
00:06:37,463 --> 00:06:40,266
Because you like them

79
00:07:01,788 --> 00:07:03,890
Was it not that interesting?

80
00:07:03,890 --> 00:07:05,925
Huh? No

81
00:07:05,925 --> 00:07:07,560
I liked it

82
00:07:07,794 --> 00:07:09,295
You did?

83
00:07:11,397 --> 00:07:13,399
Want to go to a café?

84
00:07:13,933 --> 00:07:15,401
Yeah

85
00:07:21,307 --> 00:07:24,210
“This one's from German Expressionism”

86
00:07:24,210 --> 00:07:26,279
Why does everything feel so different…

87
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:28,347
“They're known for bold colors”

88
00:07:31,417 --> 00:07:33,619
What are you watching so closely?

89
00:07:33,619 --> 00:07:35,421
Just…

90
00:07:35,855 --> 00:07:38,458
Old videos we took together

91
00:07:38,458 --> 00:07:39,826
You still have those?

92
00:07:39,826 --> 00:07:41,727
I deleted everything

93
00:07:42,528 --> 00:07:44,197
But this café…

94
00:07:44,197 --> 00:07:46,566
Didn't we come here before?

95
00:07:46,566 --> 00:07:48,668
It's changed a lot since then

96
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:53,639
Yeah… it really is different

97
00:07:56,576 --> 00:07:58,344
Jihoon…

98
00:07:59,378 --> 00:08:01,547
Us getting back together…

99
00:08:02,515 --> 00:08:04,717
Is it a mistake?

100
00:08:05,284 --> 00:08:06,819
Huh…?

101
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:14,800
"The Long Relationship"
